# 15. Selection algorithm

Exactly as you specified:

```text
              CANDIDATE
                   │
                   ▼
             QUALITY GATE
       non-inferior to baseline?
             /           \
           NO             YES
           │               │
          DEAD             ▼
                       COST TEST
                   materially cheaper?
                       /      \
                     yes      equal
                      │         │
                    KEEP        ▼
                             LATENCY
                              ↓
                           fastest
```

For accuracy, use the **true frozen labels**, not FactJudge's confidence as the optimization target.

FactJudge is part of the running system.

The benchmark label tells Cogym whether the whole pipeline succeeded.

